WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Plank or Down Dog, lower the knees softly to the mat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Keep the hips lifted slightly and lower the chest and chin toward the floor.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Eight points touch: toes, knees, chest, chin, and both hands.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Elbows stay close to the ribs; the hips stay a little high.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Slide forward into Cobra or press back to Down Dog.
